sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as React App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant VW as Video Worker
    participant DT as YOLO Detector
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>UI: Upload video
    UI->>API: POST /workspaces/{id}/analyze/video
    API->>DB: Create analysis (status queued)
    API->>VW: submit(analysis_id)
    API-->>UI: 201 queued
    VW->>DB: Status processing
    loop Every sampled frame (1 per second)
        VW->>DT: detect(frame)
        DT-->>VW: Detections
        VW->>DB: Save detections and progress
    end
    VW->>DB: Status done
    loop Until finished
        UI->>API: GET /analyses/{id}
        API-->>UI: Status and progress
    end
    UI-->>U: Results and counts
